    "children": [
     {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "rotation": 0,
      "id": 95,
      "uid": null,
      "width": 446,
      "height": 330,
      "lockAspectRatio": false,
      "lockShape": false,
      "order": "auto",
      "hidden": false,
      "layerId": "L0",
      "children": null,
      "graphic": {
       "type": "Text",
       "Text": {
        "tid": null,
        "valign": "top",
        "overflow": "none",
        "vposition": "none",
        "hposition": "none",
        "html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:12px;color:#2C2C2A;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Open questions (resolve before KT)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• Direct /banking/services/* from the SPA: where does it exit Akamai? (F5 direct, via ISAM, or unused in SIT2)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• Step 6: callback host differs from SPA host; which box serves it?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• How do APIC / CDBBOS validate the CIAM access token?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• PKCE code_challenge: sent on step 1 or step 5? DPoP proof at authorize vs dpop_jkt</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• CWH APIC → AWS API Gateway path, and AWS Lambdas → DigitalCore link</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• ISAM → F5 hop and CDBBOS → Midtier path</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">• Is Legacy ISAM retired once CIAM is live?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11px;color:#2C2C2A;\">Prod differs: Akamai GTM-CDB-BOS / GTM-CDB-API, BCC/SCC site pinning (cdbbossiteId), EXT GTM in front of BOS LTMs.</span></p>",
        "paddingLeft": 4,
        "paddingRight": 4,
        "paddingBottom": 4,
        "paddingTop": 4
       }
      }
     }
    ],
    "linkMap": []
   },
